      "description": "Université du Québec en Abitibi-Témiscamingue Cookies We use cookies to improve your user experience on Atlas. By using atlas.workland.com, you agree to our Privacy Policy. I accept Loading / Chargement... Powered by / Propulsé par: Session Timeout Due to inactivity, your session is about to expire. Logging out in null second. Log Out Stay Connected Log in Support EN Université du Québec en Abitibi-Témiscamingue Employer Profile Job Postings Job alerts Université du Québec en Abitibi-Témiscamingue 445 Boulevard de l'Université, Rouyn-Noranda, Québec, Canada J9X 5E4 +1 877 870-8728 ext 1-819-762-0971 Powered by: WORKLAND Privacy policy"
